        "locator": {
          "block_index": 3,
          "component_id": "4b3ed1ab-f0c4-50e7-9d96-86a41b7d40e7",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 487,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.235.050:block:3",
          "start": 355
        },
        "quote": "(3) Topographic information and final grading adequate to identify and properly specify planting for areas needing slope protection.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.235.050:block:3#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.235.050 block 4",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 4,
          "component_id": "e1f11e9f-9e4c-5ef1-a4dc-b087e81e88af",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 574,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.235.050:block:4",
          "start": 488
        },
        "quote": "(4) The location, size, and surface of materials for all structures and parking areas.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.235.050:block:4#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.235.050 block 5",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 5,
          "component_id": "0b80b19a-d375-5e09-a176-728f97f57995",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 743,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.235.050:block:5",
          "start": 575
        },
        "quote": "(5) The location, size, and type of all utilities and structures with notation, where appropriate, as to any safety hazards to avoid during installation of landscaping.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.235.050:block:5#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.235.050 block 6",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 6,
          "component_id": "015c819b-3cff-56df-ac5d-30d4b24f8476",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1004,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.235.050:block:6",
          "start": 744
        },
        "quote": "(6) The location, size, type, and quantity of all proposed landscaping materials, along with common and botanical names of all plant species. The size, grading, and condition shall be specified according to American Nursery and Landscape Association standards.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.235.050:block:6#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.235.050 block 7",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 7,
          "component_id": "c03118df-d2e4-52f4-af9a-8326b11909a5",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1210,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.235.050:block:7",
          "start": 1005
        },
        "quote": "(7) The location, size, and common name of all existing plant materials to be retained on the site. Procedures for preserving existing trees during construction shall be submitted and followed accordingly.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.235.050:block:7#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.235.050 block 8",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 8,
          "component_id": "e6ec3879-9476-525c-a17e-9aa40649f142",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1388,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.235.050:block:8",
          "start": 1211
        },
        "quote": "(8) Sizes of plant material shall be drawn to scale and shown at 60 percent to 70 percent of mature size, and shall be specified on the plan by a common name or appropriate key.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.235.050:block:8#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
